# 统一换行符：源码用 LF，避免 Windows 上提交后 macOS/Linux 克隆出问题
# gradlew 必须是 LF，否则 Mac/Linux 上 ./gradlew 会报 "sh\r: not found"
* text=auto eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jar binary
*.bin binary
*.apk binary
